blocks.en:
Sensitivity to Onset Layer Localization. To localize the sensitive onset layer, we evaluate three distinct selection strategies: our proposed first local peak, the global maximum peak, and a fixed numerical threshold. As detailed in Table X , the first local peak achieves the highest mean defense success rate among the evaluated criteria across all three models:
99.5 ± 0.3 \pm 0.3 % on LLaMA3-8B-Instruct, 99.4 ± 0.1 \pm 0.1 % on LLaVA-1.5-7B, and 99.3 ± 0.2 \pm 0.2 % on Stable Diffusion 1.4. The corresponding results for the global maximum peak are 84.8 ± 0.3 \pm 0.3 %, 78.4 ± 0.3 \pm 0.3 %, and 98.3 ± 0.2 \pm 0.2 %;
Fixed threshold selection yields 80.8 ± 0.3 \pm 0.3 %, 74.4 ± 0.3 \pm 0.3 %, and 96.5 ± 0.2 \pm 0.2 %, respectively. These results are consistent with the motivation for identifying an early source of harmful semantic propagation. The first local peak captures the initial prominent increase in attention sensitivity, providing a starting layer for feature extraction and downstream causal tracing. By contrast, the global maximum identifies the largest sensitivity score, which may occur after the signal has propagated through additional layers, while a fixed threshold may not accommodate differences in sensitivity profiles across models. The five-seed comparisons support the first local peak as an effective localization criterion under the evaluated settings.

blocks.zh:
对 Onset 层本地化的敏感性 。 为了使敏感发作层本地化,我们评价了三种不同的选择战略:我们提出的第一个局部峰值,全球最大峰值,以及一个固定的数值阈值. 如表X所详述,第一个局部峰值在所有三种模型的评价标准中实现了最高平均防御成功率:
在LLaMA3-8B-指令上为99.5±0.3\pm 0.3%,在LLaVA-1.5-7B上为99.4±0.1\pm 0.1%,在稳定扩散1.4上为99.3±0.2\pm 0.2%. 全球最大峰值的相应结果为:84.8±0.3\pm0.3%,78.4±0.3\pm0.3%,98.3±0.2\pm0.2%;
固定阈值选择的产量分别为80.8±0.3\pm 0.3%,74.4±0.3\pm 0.3%,96.5±0.2\pm 0.2%. 这些结果与查明有害语义传播的早期来源的动机是一致的。 第一个局部峰值捕捉了注意力灵敏度的初始显著提高,为地物提取和下游因果追踪提供了起始层. 相比之下,全球极限识别出最大的灵敏度分数,可能在信号通过额外的层层传播后出现,而固定的阈值可能无法容纳不同模型的灵敏度剖面的差异. 五种子比较支持第一个局部峰值,作为评价设置下有效的本地化标准.
